GDrive in yazi (no FUSE):
  ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -f ~/.ssh/gdrive_sftp -N ""
  bin/gdserve      # start/stop/status local SFTP bridge on 127.0.0.1:2022 (auto-starts in .bashrc)
  yazi keymap g d  # cd sftp://gd  (vfs.toml registers host)
  vfs.toml has [sftp.gd] host=127.0.0.1 user=gd port=2022 key_file=~/.ssh/gdrive_sftp

